# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Image data (large NIfTI volumes) — NOT tracked
#   Only the actual image data is excluded. Everything else under data/
#   (metadata CSVs, split definitions + notebooks, per-subject
#   preprocessing_metadata.json, inventories) stays version-controlled so it
#   remains referenceable.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nii.gz

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model weights / checkpoints / large binary artifacts — NOT tracked
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.pb
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.tflite
*.bin
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.joblib
checkpoints/
weights/
runs/
outputs/
logs/
wandb/
mlruns/
lightning_logs/
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python / uv
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.python-version
# uv.lock IS committed (reproducible env) — do not ignore it.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets / certs (Tailscale node cert+key live at repo root) — NEVER track
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.key
*.crt
*.pem
spark-*.ts.net.*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Session / scratch — NOT tracked
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/scratchpad/
.claude-memory/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor junk
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.env
